      "label": "Finish second or better without a single lap managing the tyres"
    },
    "hardCalls": {
      "NOR": 0,
      "HAM": 0
    },
    "briefing": "Silverstone, 2023. Norris took the lead at the start, but Verstappen was back past within five laps. You run Norris, second and 9.0 s behind him after 30 laps, still on the mediums he started on. McLaren has just stopped Piastri from third for hards, so Hamilton is third on old mediums. Hold on to second."
